# Power BI binary files (contain sensitive embedded data)
*.pbix
*.pbix.tmp
*.pbix.lock

# Power BI local/user-specific settings
.pbi/
**/.pbi/

# Auto-generated date tables (Power BI regenerates these on open)
**/tables/LocalDateTable_*.tmdl
**/tables/DateTableTemplate_*.tmdl

# Auto-generated / bundled assets (not meaningful code)
**/cultures/en-US.tmdl
**/diagramLayout.json
**/StaticResources/


# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Editor/IDE
.vscode/
*.suo
*.user

# Logs
*.log

# Extraction temp folder
.pbix_extracted/
